## Step 4: Configure Bean Using XML

### player.xml

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<!DOCTYPE beans PUBLIC
"-//SPRING//DTD BEAN 2.0//EN"
"https://www.springframework.org/dtd/spring-beans-2.0.dtd">

<beans>

    <bean id="p"
          class="org.techhub.Player">

