# Internal Working of Setter Injection

When Spring reads:

```xml
<property name="id" value="1"/>
```

it internally performs:

```java
Player p = new Player();

p.setId(1);
p.setName("Virat");
p.setRun(12000);
```

Thus Spring injects values through setter methods.

