# Important Difference

| Setter Injection                           | Constructor Injection                |
| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------ |
| Uses setter methods                        | Uses constructor                     |
| Uses `<property>` tag                      | Uses `<constructor-arg>` tag         |
| Object created first, then values assigned | Values passed while object creation  |
| Good for optional dependencies             | Good for mandatory dependencies      |
| Can change values later                    | Values usually fixed during creation |

